            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Plotinus: The Founder of Neoplatonism</strong><br>\nPlotinus was an influential philosopher in ancient times who founded Neoplatonism. Born around 204/5 AD, he sought to interpret Plato's ideas for a new era. Plotinus proposed that there is a supreme, singular form of reality, known as The One, from which all existence derives. He believed that The One is perfect and generates the first intellect or divine mind, which then creates the soul of the world.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Early Life and Education</strong><br>\nPlotinus's early life is not well-documented, but we know he studied philosophy for 11 years under the teacher Ammonius Saccas in Alexandria, a melting pot of religious and philosophical ideas. Determined to learn more about philosophy and the systems of the East, he joined the Roman Emperor Gordian's campaign against Persia. After Gordian's death, Plotinus settled in Rome.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Philosophical Teachings</strong><br>\nIn Rome, Plotinus established his own school of philosophy where he taught a form of Platonic thought that was infused with spirituality. His philosophy was built on the existence of a single source of goodness and reality—The One. According to Plotinus, humans can achieve union with The One through philosophical contemplation and self-improvement.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
